Well, the demigod rumor is actually true, in a misleading sort of way.
From the source code, I have gathered the fact that after killing the wizard,
a flag is set on your character called u.udemigod for a period of time.
I haven't really researched what this flag causes to happen, but I believe
it serves to make the game harder while it is set, and perhaps might control
when the wizard can reappear.  (I'm not firm on any of this, so if any of
you master source hackers want to straighten me out, feel free....) 
Anyway, killing the wizard technically does make you a demigod, only not
it the way you might have thought...

